      "text": "Vacuuming is another crucial cleaning service that is particularly important in Minneapolis. The city’s cold winters mean that people spend more time indoors, leading to a buildup of dirt and debris on floors and carpets. Our professional vacuuming services ensure that your home is free from dirt and dust, providing a more pleasant and hygienic living environment.",
      "title": "Vacuuming",
      "width": 401,
